	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Navigate GitHub from Alfred.

Configure the workflow (Configure Workflow… in Alfred):
- GH_OWNERS — comma-separated organizations and users whose repositories are listed (default: your gh login)
- EDITOR_APP — application that opens local clones (default: Visual Studio Code)
- JIRA_URL — base URL that ticket keys are appended to (empty: the Jira modifier is disabled)

Requires the GitHub CLI (brew install gh) authenticated with gh auth login.</string>
